     tips = {"Clap when the pack reaches you. When it goes out, Cleave is queued on your next swing too (off the global cooldown), so two enemies take extra threat.", "Only a Clap that lands queues Cleave, so mashing the button while Clap cools down costs nothing.", "Short on Rage after a Clap? That is the 20-Rage Cleave: it only queues when you can afford it after the Clap."}},
