     tips = {"Clap in Battle or Defensive, with Cleave queued on the same press. From Berserker the first press switches stance.", "Only a Clap that lands queues Cleave, so mashing the button while Clap cools down costs nothing.", "On this plan Clap costs 14 Rage at 30 and 11 with maxed Focused Rage at 33."}},
