     tips = {"One interrupt in every stance: Pummel in Berserker, Shield Bash with a shield in Battle or Defensive. With a mouse, the enemy under your cursor is interrupted without changing target.", "No shield and not in Berserker: the first press switches to Berserker, the next Pummels."}},
