     tips = {"Press when it lights up. In Defensive it is Revenge (after you block, dodge or parry, 5 Rage); in Battle it is Overpower (after the enemy dodges). They share a 5-second cooldown.", "From 16, Shield Block rides along whenever it is ready (off the global cooldown): more blocks mean more Revenge, and with Shield Specialization 5/5 every block pays 5 Rage back."}},
