st_glacier", "inv_misc_gem_ruby_01", "spell_magearmor", "spell_fire_soulburn"}}, {level = 60, spells = {"Frostbolt (Rank 11)", "Blizzard (Rank 6)", "Ice Armor (Rank 4)", "Mana Shield (Rank 6)", "Conjure Water (Rank 7)", "Conjure Food (Rank 7)", "Polymorph (Rank 4)", "Frostfire Bolt (Rank 3)", "Frost Ward (Rank 5)", "Fire Ward (Rank 5)", "Dampen Magic (Rank 5)", "Fireball (Rank 12)"}, notes = {"Your main nuke. Always train new ranks.", "Your main pack-killer.", "More armor than Frost Armor. Keep it on while questing.", "Emergency absorb before Ice Barrier.", "Free drinks — saves a lot of gold.", "Free food.", "Sheep the extra mob.", "Fire-Frost hybrid; Frostbolt stays your nuke.", "Vs. frost casters.", "Vs. fire casters.", "Situational vs. casters.", "Frostbolt replaces it at 4."}, icons = {"spell_frost_frostbolt02", "spell_frost_icestorm", "spell_frost_frostarmor02", "spell_shadow_detectlesserinvisibility", "inv_drink_06", "inv_misc_food_10", "spell_nature_polymorph", "ability_mage_frostfirebolt", "spell_frost_frostward", "spell_fire_firearmor", "spell_nature_abolishmagic", "spell_fire_flamebolt"}}}, br = {{level = 1, icon = "spell_holy_magicalsentry", title = "Before Talents", range = "Levels 1–9", intro = "Pull from max range. Every kill you finish without taking a hit is a kill you don't have to eat or drink after.", steps = {"Arcane Intellect and Frost Armor on at all times.", "Fireball until 4, then Frostbolt from max range — the slow buys you a free second cast.", "Fire Blast (6+) as an instant finisher when the mob reaches you.", "Finish low targets with your wand (Shoot) to save mana.", "Conjure your own water (4+) and food (6+) — drink between pulls."}, stepIcons = {"spell_holy_magicalsentry", "spell_frost_frostbolt02", "spell_fire_fireball", "inv_wand_01", "inv_drink_06"}}, {level = 10, icon = "spell_frost_frostbolt02", title = "The Nova Dance", range = "Levels 10–19", intro = "Frost Nova arrives at 10. Frostbolt slows, Nova roots — together most melee mobs barely touch you.", steps = {"Frostbolt from max range, then a second as it closes in slowed.", "Frost Nova when it reaches you, walk a few steps away, Frostbolt again.", "Fire Blast to finish.", "Two or more on you? Nova them, then Arcane Explosion (14+).", "Polymorph an add before it joins.", "Controller: Nuke on RT+A, Finisher on RT+B, Get away (Frost Nova) on LT+A."}, stepIcons = {"spell_frost_frostbolt02", "spell_frost_frostnova", "spell_fire_fireball", "spell_nature_wispsplode", "spell_nature_polymorph", "inv_misc_note_01"}}, {level = 20, icon = "spell_frost_frostbolt02", title = "Shatter", range = "Levels 20–29", intro = "Ice Lance (20) hits frozen targets for 300% more; Shatter (26–28) adds up to 50% crit chance against them. Freeze first, then burst.", steps = {"Frostbolt, Frostbolt as it closes.", "Frost Nova when it reaches you.", "Ice Lance while it's frozen — then Frostbolt again before the ice breaks.", "See ice from a Frostbite proc? Lance it immediately.", "Nova on cooldown and a mob on you: Blink away.", "Packs: Blizzard (20), then Cone of Cold (26) as they arrive.", "Evocation when low on mana instead of sitting to drink.", "Bad pull: Ice Block (29), then Blink away when it ends."}, stepIcons = {"spell_frost_frostbolt02", "spell_frost_frostnova", "spell_frost_frostblast", "spell_frost_frostarmor", "spell_arcane_blink", "spell_frost_icestorm", "spell_nature_purge", "spell_frost_frost"}}, {level = 30, icon = "ability_mage_wintersgrasp", title = "Fingers of Frost", range = "Levels 30–39", intro = "Fingers of Frost makes your next two spells act as if the target were frozen. Every proc is a free Shatter — no Nova needed.", steps = {"Fingers of Frost lit? Ice Lance, then Frostbolt — both shatter.", "Ice Armor (30) on instead of Frost Armor.", "Cold Snap (34) resets Nova and Ice Block for a second go on hard fights.", "Packs: Nova, Cone of Cold, Arcane Explosion.", "Counterspell healers and casters (24+)."}, stepIcons = {"ability_mage_wintersgrasp", "spell_frost_frostarmor02", "spell_frost_wizardmark", "spell_frost_glacier", "spell_frost_iceshock"}}, {level = 40, icon = "spell_ice_lament", title = "Ice Barrier", range = "Levels 40–60", intro = "Ice Barrier on a 30 sec cooldown absorbs damage and adds 15% Frost damage — 20% while it holds. Keep it up constantly with the Shield up button.", steps = {"Ice Barrier before every pull and whenever it's ready.", "Frostbolt as your filler.", "Nova → Ice Lance → Frostbolt, and Lance on every Fingers of Frost.", "Mana gem first, Evocation second, drinking last.", "Blizzard packs — with Improved Blizzard (48+) its chill can trigger Frostbite freezes. Keep its rank current, or those procs drop."}, stepIcons = {"spell_ice_lament", "spell_frost_frostbolt02", "spell_frost_frostblast", "inv_misc_gem_ruby_01", "spell_frost_icestorm"}}}, spec = "Frost", guide = "Frost Mage"},
  HUNTER = {macros = {{name = "Fight", title = "Fight", icon = "ability_impalingbolt", lo = 6, hi = 19, body = "#showtooltip\n/petattack\n/cast !Auto Shot\n/castsequence reset=target Hunter's Mark, Serpent Sting, Arcane Shot, Arcane Shot, Arcane Shot", pad = "RT+A", kb = "1", tips = {"Each press: Sends your pet, keeps Auto Shot running, then casts the next shot: Mark → Serpent → Arcane ×3.", "\"Not ready\": Arcane Shot's 6 sec cooldown — Auto Shot keeps firing, just press again."}}, {name = "Fight", title = "Fight", icon = "inv_spear_07", lo = 20, hi = 60, body = "#showtooltip\n/petattack\n/cast !Auto Shot\n/castsequence reset=target Hunter's Mark, Serpent Sting, Aimed Shot, Arcane Shot, Aimed Shot, Arcane Shot", pad = "RT+A", kb = "1", tips = {"Each press: Pet in, Auto Shot on, then Mark → Serpent → Aimed → Arcane → Aimed → Arcane.", "\"Not ready\": Aimed Shot has a 6 sec cooldown (shared with Multi-Shot), so the second Aimed can wait a moment. Auto Shot keeps firing — even during the Aimed cast in Forever — just press again.", "New target: Starts over at Hunter's Mark.", "From 40: Same macro. Put Sniper Shot on its own opener button."}}, {name = "Sniper opener", title = "Sniper opener", icon = "hunter_pvp_snipershot", lo = 40, hi = 60, body = "#showtooltip\n/petattack\n/cast Sniper Shot", pad = "RT+→", kb = "3", tips = {"How to open: Fight once (Hunter's Mark + pet in), then this — the 4 sec cast lands while the pet takes the hit — then keep pressing Fight (Serpent → Aimed → Arcane).", "Why its own button: Sniper Shot has a 15 sec cooldown. Inside the Fight sequence it stalled every quick chain-pull until the cooldown came back; here you only press it when it's ready."}}, {name = "Pack", title = "Pack", icon = "ability_upgrademoonglaive", lo = 18, hi = 60, body = "#showtooltip\n/petattack\n/cast !Auto Shot\n/cast Multi-Shot", pad = "RT+B", kb = "2", tips = {"One press: Pet in, Auto Shot on, Multi-Shot."}}, {name = "Too close", title = "Too close", icon = "ability_rogue_trip", lo = 12, hi = 60, body = "#showtooltip\n/startattack\n/castsequence reset=8/target Wing Clip, Raptor Strike", pad = "LT+Y", kb = "Q", tips = {"Press: Wing Clip slows it, then Raptor Strike.", "Then: Walk out past 8 yards — Auto Shot and your Shots can't fire inside 8 — and go back to Fight.", "Why only one Raptor: Raptor Strike has a 6 sec cooldown, so a second one in the sequence just waited."}}, {name = "Pet care", title = "Pet care", icon = "ability_hunter_mendpet", lo = 10, hi = 60, body = "#showtooltip\n/cast [@pet,dead] Revive Pet; [nopet] Call Pet; Mend Pet", pad = "LT+A", kb = "E", tips = {"Pet dead: Revive Pet.", "Pet dismissed: Call Pet.", "Pet alive: Mend Pet (12+)."}}, {name = "Pet back", title = "Pet back", icon = "spell_nature_spiritwolf", lo = 10, hi = 60, body = "#showtooltip\n/petfollow", pad = "LT+B", kb = "R", tips = {"One press: Pet stops and runs back to you. Use it when the pet chases a runner into a new pack."}}, {name = "Feed pet", title = "Feed pet", icon = "ability_hunter_beasttraining", lo = 10, hi = 60, body = "#showtooltip Feed Pet\n/cast Feed Pet\n/use Tough Jerky", pad = "LT+↓", kb = "Shift+4", tips = {"Edit first: Replace \"Tough Jerky\" with food your pet eats (its diet shows in the pet window).", "When: Out of combat, every few fights — keep it happy."}}}, plan = {{name = "Lethal Attacks", tree = "Marksmanship", from = 10, to = 14, why = "+5% crit on every attack — Forever widened it from shots to everything, Auto Shot and melee included. The best first five points for a ranged Hunter.", more = "+1% more crit.", max = 5, icon = "ability_searingarrow"}, {name = "Careful Aim", tree = "Marksmanship", from = 15, to = 19, why = "New in Forever: 100% of your Intellect becomes Attack Power at 5/5. Hunter mail is full of Intellect, so this is a big free damage boost — and it is the prerequisite for Mortal Shots.", more = "+20% more of your Intellect as AP.", max = 5, icon = "ability_hunter_zenarchery"}, {name = "Rapid Killing", tree = "Marksmanship", from = 20, to = 21, why = "Rapid Fire (+40% attack speed) comes back 2 min sooner, and after every non-trivial kill — or a mob dying with your Serpent Sting on it — your next Shot within 20 sec hits 20% harder. Perfect for chain-pulling.", more = "Faster Rapid Fire, bigger post-kill shot.", max = 2, icon = "ability_hunter_rapidkilling"}, {name = "Improved Stings", tree = "Marksmanship", from = 22, to = 24, why = "Serpent Sting is on every target, so +20% is free damage. It also shortens Viper Sting's new 15 sec cooldown.", more = "More Serpent Sting damage.", max = 3, icon = "ability_hunter_quickshot"}, {name = "Trueshot Aura", tree = "Marksmanship", from = 25, to = 25, why = "The earliest it opens (row 4 needs 15 points). Ranged Attack Power for you and your group — +20 now, growing to +100 by 60 as you train its ranks — and the prerequisite for Sniper Shot at 40.", more = "", max = 1, icon = "ability_trueshot"}, {name = "Mortal Shots", tree = "Marksmanship", from = 26, to = 30, why = "Needs Careful Aim 5/5. Ranged crits deal 30% more bonus damage. With Lethal Attacks you crit a lot — this makes each one count.", more = "+6% more crit damage.", max = 5, icon = "ability_piercedamage"}, {name = "Barrage", tree = "Marksmanship", from = 31, to = 33, why = "Aimed Shot, Multi-Shot and Volley hit 15% harder.", more = "+5% more.", max = 3, icon = "ability_upgrademoonglaive"}, {name = "Rapid Recuperation", tree = "Marksmanship", from = 34, to = 34, why = "Needs Rapid Killing. After Serpent Sting hits, 25% of your mana regen keeps going while you cast for 15 sec — fewer drink breaks.", more = "", max = 2, icon = "ability_hunter_rapidregeneration"}, {name = "Ranged Weapon Specialization", tree = "Marksmanship", from = 35, to = 39, why = "+5% ranged weapon damage: Auto Shot and every Shot.", more = "+1% more.", max = 5, icon = "inv_weapon_rifle_06"}, {name = "Sniper Shot", tree = "Marksmanship", from = 40, to = 40, why = "The capstone, open the moment you hit 40 (30 points, Trueshot Aura taken). A 4 sec cast from up to 45 yards on a 15 sec cooldown that hits hard (doubled in the 2 Nov update) and gives your next 3 shots +10 yards. Use it as your opener button.", more = "", max = 1, icon = "hunter_pvp_snipershot"}, {name = "Rapid Recuperation", tree = "Marksmanship", from = 41, to = 41, why = "Second point: 50% of mana regen while casting after a Serpent Sting, 100% once you spend Rapid Killing.", more = "", max = 2, icon = "ability_hunter_rapidregeneration"}, {name = "Hawk Eye", tree = "Marksmanship", from = 42, to = 44, why = "+6 yards range: pull from further away and get an extra shot in before anything reaches you.", more = "+2 more yards.", max = 3, icon = "ability_townwatch"}, {name = "Efficiency", tree = "Marksmanship", from = 45, to = 49, why = "Shots, Stings and (new in Forever) melee abilities 15% cheaper — mana is what stops long questing sessions.", more = "3% cheaper again.", max = 5, icon = "spell_frost_wizardmark"}, {name = "Deadly Aspects", tree = "Beast Mastery", from = 50, to = 54, why = "Every Marksmanship talent worth having is done. Deadly Aspects (Beast Mastery row 1) gives Auto Shot a 10% chance at 5/5 for +30% attack speed for 12 sec with Aspect of the Hawk.", more = "+2% more proc chance.", max = 5, icon = "spell_nature_ravenform"}, {name = "Focused Fire", tree = "Beast Mastery", from = 55, to = 56, why = "New in Forever: you and your pet deal 2% more while it is out — and you always have it out.", more = "+1% more.", max = 2, icon = "inv_weapon_crossbow_10"}, {name = "Improved Tracking", tree = "Survival", from = 57, to = 60, why = "New in Forever (merges Monster and Humanoid Slaying): track the creature type you are fighting (not herbs/ore) for +4% damage against it with these four points.", more = "+1% more.", max = 5, icon = "inv_misc_head_dragon_black"}}, train = {{level = 1, spells = {"Auto Shot", "Raptor Strike (Rank 1)", "Track Beasts"}, notes = {"Your main damage. Fires only past 8 yards and after half a second standing still; keeps firing while you cast Aimed Shot. The Fight macro keeps it running.", "Melee hit for when a mob reaches you.", "Find and track — with Improved Tracking (57+) also +damage."}, icons = {"ability_whirlwind", "ability_meleedamage", "ability_tracking"}}, {level = 4, spells = {"Serpent Sting (Rank 1)", "Aspect of the Monkey"}, notes = {"DoT on every target.", "+8% dodge when something is on you."}, icons = {"ability_hunter_quickshot", "ability_hunter_aspectofthemonkey"}}, {level = 6, spells = {"Hunter's Mark (Rank 1)", "Arcane Shot (Rank 1)"}, notes = {"More Ranged Attack Power against the target.", "Instant shot, 6 sec cooldown."}, icons = {"ability_hunter_snipershot", "ability_impalingbolt"}}, {level = 8, spells = {"Raptor Strike (Rank 2)", "Concussive Shot"}, notes = {"Melee hit for when a mob reaches you.", "Slow runners and approaching mobs."}, icons = {"ability_meleedamage", "spell_frost_stun"}}, {level = 10, spells = {"Aspect of the Hawk (Rank 1)", "Tame Beast", "Beast Training", "Serpent Sting (Rank 2)", "Track Humanoids"}, notes = {"Your normal aspect — always on in fights.", "Class quest at 10 — your pet kit: Tame Beast, Call, Dismiss, Revive and Feed Pet.", "Train your pet: keep Growl at its best rank so it holds aggro.", "DoT on every target.", "Tracking."}, icons = {"spell_nature_ravenform", "ability_hunter_beasttaming", "ability_hunter_beastcall02", "ability_hunter_quickshot", "spell_holy_prayerofhealing"}}, {level = 12, spells = {"Mend Pet (Rank 1)", "Arcane Shot (Rank 2)", "Wing Clip (Rank 1)", "Distracting Shot (Rank 1)"}, notes = {"Heal your pet over time.", "Instant shot, 6 sec cooldown.", "Slow in melee, then step out.", "Group utility."}, icons = {"ability_hunter_mendpet", "ability_impalingbolt", "ability_rogue_trip", "spell_arcane_blink"}}, {level = 14, spells = {"Scare Beast (Rank 1)", "Eagle Eye", "Eyes of the Beast"}, notes = {"Fear an extra beast.", "Scouting.", "Scouting."}, icons = {"ability