.", "Serpent Sting (4), then Arcane Shot (6). Hunter's Mark (6) before you pull.", "When it reaches you: Raptor Strike and melee it down.", "Concussive Shot (8) on anything that runs."}, stepIcons = {"ability_whirlwind", "ability_hunter_quickshot", "ability_meleedamage", "spell_frost_stun"}}, {level = 10, icon = "ability_hunter_beasttaming", title = "Your Pet", range = "Levels 10–19", intro = "Do your level-10 class quest to tame a beast, then feed it at once. From now on it tanks and you shoot.", steps = {"Any beast your level works; a cat or boar hits hardest, a bear or turtle tanks best.", "Aspect of the Hawk on at all times.", "Send the pet first (pet bar Attack), count 2 seconds, then press Fight.", "Hunter's Mark → Serpent Sting → Arcane Shot, with Auto Shot running between.", "Mend Pet (12) when it drops under half health.", "Mob on you? Wing Clip (12), step back past 8 yards, keep shooting.", "Multi-Shot (18) when 2–3 mobs are grouped."}, stepIcons = {"ability_hunter_beasttaming", "spell_nature_ravenform", "ability_hunter_beastcall", "ability_impalingbolt", "ability_hunter_mendpet", "ability_rogue_trip", "ability_upgrademoonglaive"}}, {level = 20, icon = "inv_spear_07", title = "Aimed Shot", range = "Levels 20–29", intro = "Aimed Shot is trainable at 20 in Forever: a 2-second cast on a 6-second cooldown shared with Multi-Shot. With the pet holding aggro you have time to cast it.", steps = {"Mark → Serpent → Aimed Shot → Arcane Shot.", "Freezing Trap (20) works in combat in Forever — drop it at your feet for an add. All traps share a 30 sec cooldown.", "Aspect of the Cheetah (20) for travel; switch back to Hawk before fights.", "Trueshot Aura (25) on always; from 40 it lasts 30 min, so recast it.", "Rapid Fire (26) on tough mobs; Rapid Killing (20–21) brings it back faster."}, stepIcons = {"inv_spear_07", "spell_frost_chainsofice", "ability_mount_jungletiger", "ability_trueshot", "ability_hunter_runningshot"}}, {level = 30, icon = "ability_rogue_feigndeath", title = "Feign Death", range = "Levels 30–39", intro = "Feign Death (30) drops all threat — your reset on bad pulls. Mortal Shots and Barrage make crits and Aimed Shots much stronger.", steps = {"Too much on you: Feign Death, let the pet tank or die, stand up and shoot.", "Explosive Trap (34) at your feet, then pull the pack onto it.", "Pet died? Revive Pet out of combat — the Pet care button does it.", "Feed Pet after every few fights to keep it happy — unhappy pets deal less damage."}, stepIcons = {"ability_rogue_feigndeath", "spell_fire_selfdestruct", "ability_hunter_beastsoothe", "ability_hunter_beasttraining"}}, {level = 40, icon = "hunter_pvp_snipershot", title = "Sniper Shot", range = "Levels 40–60", intro = "Sniper Shot (40) is a 4-second, 45-yard opener that hits hard and adds 10 yards to your next 3 shots. Open every pull with it.", steps = {"Fight once (Mark, pet in) → Sniper opener from max range → keep pressing Fight (Serpent → Aimed → Arcane).", "Volley (40) on a pack your pet is holding.", "Rapid Fire on elites and rough pulls.", "Aspect of the Pack (40) for group travel — anyone hit is dazed."}, stepIcons = {"hunter_pvp_snipershot", "ability_marksmanship", "ability_hunter_runningshot", "ability_mount_whitetiger"}}}, spec = "Marksmanship", guide = "Marksmanship Hunter"},
  DRUID = {macros = {{name = "Fight", title = "Fight", icon = "spell_nature_abolishmagic", lo = 4, hi = 9, body = "#showtooltip\n/startattack\n/castsequence reset=target Wrath, Moonfire, Wrath", pad = "RT+A", kb = "1", tips = {"Each press: Wrath → Moonfire → Wrath, then melee.", "New target: Starts over with Wrath."}}, {name = "Fight Bear", title = "Fight — Bear", icon = "ability_druid_maul", lo = 10, hi = 60, body = "#showtooltip\n/startattack\n/castsequence reset=target Demoralizing Roar, Maul, Maul, Maul", pad = "RT+A (in Bear Form)", kb = "1 (in Bear Form)", tips = {"Each press: Demoralizing Roar, then Maul.", "Where: Bear Form bar — it swaps in when you shift."}}, {name = "Fight Cat", title = "Fight — Cat", icon = "ability_druid_rake", lo = 20, hi = 23, body = "#showtooltip\n/startattack\n/castsequence reset=target Claw, Claw, Claw, Rip", pad = "RT+A (in Cat Form)", kb = "1 (in Cat Form)", tips = {"Each press: Claw ×3, then Rip.", "\"Not enough energy\": Keep pressing — it waits for Energy, then continues."}}, {name = "Fight Cat", title = "Fight — Cat", icon = "ability_druid_ferociousbite", lo = 24, hi = 60, body = "#showtooltip\n/startattack\n/castsequence reset=target Rake, Claw, Claw, Claw, Ferocious Bite", pad = "RT+A (in Cat Form)", kb = "1 (in Cat Form)", tips = {"Each press: Rake → Claw ×3 → Ferocious Bite.", "New target: Starts over with Rake."}}, {name = "Pack Bear", title = "Pack — Bear", icon = "inv_misc_monsterclaw_03", lo = 16, hi = 60, body = "#showtooltip\n/startattack\n/castsequence reset=target Demoralizing Roar, Swipe, Maul, Swipe", pad = "RT+B (in Bear Form)", kb = "2 (in Bear Form)", tips = {"When: 2+ mobs on you. Shift to Bear first.", "Each press: Roar → Swipe → Maul → Swipe."}}, {name = "Heal up", title = "Heal up", icon = "spell_nature_healingtouch", lo = 1, hi = 60, body = "#showtooltip\n/cancelform\n/cast [@player] Healing Touch", pad = "LT+A", kb = "Q", tips = {"One press: Drops your form and heals you, even with an enemy targeted.", "Then: Shift back to Cat or Bear."}}}, plan = {{name = "Ferocity", tree = "Feral Combat", from = 10, to = 14, why = "At 5/5 Maul (and Swipe at 16) cost 5 less Rage; Claw (20) and Rake (24) cost 5 less Energy.", more = "1 less Rage or Energy more.", max = 5, icon = "ability_hunter_pet_hyena"}, {name = "Heart of the Wild", tree = "Restoration", from = 15, to = 19, why = "Restoration row 1 (Forever moved it out of Feral): +20% Stamina in Bear, +10% Strength in Cat, +10% Intellect.", more = "Bigger form bonuses.", max = 5, icon = "spell_holy_blessingofagility"}, {name = "Feral Swiftness", tree = "Feral Combat", from = 20, to = 21, why = "Your Cat Form (20) runs 30% faster — less walking between mobs — and +4% dodge.", more = "", max = 2, icon = "spell_nature_spiritwolf"}, {name = "Thick Hide", tree = "Feral Combat", from = 22, to = 24, why = "+3 base Armor per level in forms (about +70 at 24): fewer heals between pulls. Opens row 3.", more = "+1 Armor per level more.", max = 3, icon = "inv_misc_pelt_bear_03"}, {name = "Sharpened Claws", tree = "Feral Combat", from = 25, to = 26, why = "+6% crit in Cat and Bear — and Blood Frenzy (33) turns those crits into extra combo points.", more = "", max = 2, icon = "inv_misc_monsterclaw_04"}, {name = "Savage Fury", tree = "Feral Combat", from = 27, to = 28, why = "Claw, Rake, Shred, Maul and Swipe deal 10% more.", more = "", max = 2, icon = "ability_druid_ravage"}, {name = "Shredding Attacks", tree = "Feral Combat", from = 29, to = 29, why = "Shred costs 6 less Energy. Your 15th Feral point — opens row 4 for Predatory Strikes at 30.", more = "", max = 3, icon = "spell_shadow_vampiricaura"}, {name = "Predatory Strikes", tree = "Feral Combat", from = 30, to = 32, why = "Earliest it opens. Attack Power in forms +150% of your level (+48 at 32, +90 at 60). Unlocks Rend and Tear.", more = "+50% of level more.", max = 3, icon = "ability_hunter_pet_cat"}, {name = "Blood Frenzy", tree = "Feral Combat", from = 33, to = 34, why = "Needs Sharpened Claws 2/2. At 2/2 every Claw or Rake crit adds an extra combo point; Bear crits give 5 Rage.", more = "Now on every crit.", max = 2, icon = "ability_ghoulfrenzy"}, {name = "Leader of the Pack", tree = "Feral Combat", from = 35, to = 35, why = "Earliest it opens (20 Feral points). +3% crit for you and your group while in forms.", more = "", max = 1, icon = "spell_nature_unyeildingstamina"}, {name = "Natural Instinct", tree = "Feral Combat", from = 36, to = 37, why = "Your ability crits get a 20% bigger bonus, and heals gain 25% of your Intellect as healing power.", more = "", max = 2, icon = "ability_druid_predatoryinstincts"}, {name = "Shredding Attacks", tree = "Feral Combat", from = 38, to = 39, why = "Shredding Attacks 3/3 (Shred 18 less Energy) — your 25th Feral point, so row 6 opens at 40.", more = "", max = 3, icon = "spell_shadow_vampiricaura"}, {name = "Rend and Tear", tree = "Feral Combat", from = 40, to = 44, why = "Earliest it opens. +3% ability damage per point (15% at 5/5) on bleeding targets — open with Rake.", more = "+3% more.", max = 5, icon = "ability_druid_primalagression"}, {name = "Predatory Discipline", tree = "Feral Combat", from = 45, to = 45, why = "Ferocious Bite stops eating your spare Energy but still hits harder from it. Unlocks Shifting Power.", more = "", max = 1, icon = "spell_druid_savagery"}, {name = "Shifting Power", tree = "Feral Combat", from = 46, to = 46, why = "Row 7 (30 Feral points). Spend 55% of base mana for 40 Energy, 8 sec cooldown — your Energy refill.", more = "", max = 1, icon = "spell_druid_displacement"}, {name = "Furor", tree = "Feral Combat", from = 47, to = 51, why = "At 5/5, shifting back to Cat after a heal keeps your old Energy plus 10 per sec spent out of form (up to 100).", more = "+20% Energy kept, +2 per sec.", max = 5, icon = "spell_holy_blessingofstamina"}, {name = "Genesis", tree = "Balance", from = 52, to = 56, why = "Balance row 1: Rake, Rip and Rejuvenation tick 10% harder at 5/5.", more = "+2% more.", max = 5, icon = "spell_arcane_arcane03"}, {name = "Nature's Majesty", tree = "Balance", from = 57, to = 58, why = "Balance row 2 (opened by Genesis): +4% crit with spells and melee.", more = "", max = 2, icon = "inv_staff_01"}, {name = "Feral Instinct", tree = "Feral Combat", from = 59, to = 60, why = "Swipe deals 20% more for Bear packs; Prowl is harder to spot.", more = "", max = 3, icon = "ability_ambush"}}, train = {{level = 1, spells = {"Wrath", "Healing Touch", "Mark of the Wild"}, notes = {"Pull from range.", "Big heal between pulls.", "Keep it up."}, icons = {"spell_nature_abolishmagic", "spell_nature_healingtouch", "spell_nature_regeneration"}}, {level = 4, spells = {"Moonfire", "Rejuvenation"}, notes = {"Instant pull.", "Heal over time."}, icons = {"spell_nature_starfall", "spell_nature_rejuvenation"}}, {level = 6, spells = {"Thorns", "Train new ranks of your attacks and heals every visit."}, notes = {"Free damage when hit.", "Train new ranks of your attacks and heals every visit."}, icons = {"spell_nature_thorns", "inv_misc_book_09"}}, {level = 8, spells = {"Entangling Roots", "Train new ranks of your attacks and heals every visit."}, notes = {"Root a runner or an extra mob.", "Train new ranks of your attacks and heals every visit."}, icons = {"spell_nature_stranglevines", "inv_misc_book_09"}}, {level = 10, spells = {"Bear Form", "Maul", "Demoralizing Roar", "Growl", "Nature's Grasp", "Teleport: Moonglade"}, notes = {"From a quest at 10, not the trainer.", "Bear: next-swing hit.", "Bear: less damage taken.", "Groups.", "Roots the next melee attacker. Castable in forms; lasts 45 sec.", "Travel."}, icons = {"ability_racial_bearform", "ability_druid_maul", "ability_druid_demoralizingroar", "ability_physical_taunt", "spell_nature_natureswrath", "spell_arcane_teleportmoonglade"}}, {level = 12, spells = {"Regrowth", "Enrage", "Revive", "Train new ranks of your attacks and heals every visit."}, notes = {"Heal plus heal over time.", "Rage to open in Bear.", "Resurrect, out of combat only.", "Train new ranks of your attacks and heals every visit."}, icons = {"spell_nature_resistnature", "ability_druid_enrage", "ability_druid_lunarguidance", "inv_misc_book_09"}}, {level = 14, spells = {"Bash", "Cure Poison", "Train new ranks of your attacks and heals every visit."}, notes = {"Bear stun / interrupt.", "Utility.", "Train new ranks of your attacks and heals every visit."}, icons = {"ability_druid_bash", "spell_nature_nullifypoison", "inv_misc_book_09"}}, {level = 16, spells = {"Swipe", "Aquatic Form", "Train new ranks of your attacks and heals every visit."}, notes = {"Bear: hits up to 3 nearby enemies.", "From a quest at 16.", "Train new ranks of your attacks and heals every visit."}, icons = {"inv_misc_monsterclaw_03", "ability_druid_aquaticform", "inv_misc_book_09"}}, {level = 18, spells = {"Faerie Fire", "Hibernate", "Train new ranks of your attacks and heals every visit."}, notes = {"Armor down for 40 sec. Caster form only — pull with it, then shift.", "Beast/dragonkin CC.", "Train new ranks of your attacks and heals every visit."}, icons = {"spell_nature_faeriefire", "spell_nature_sleep", "inv_misc_book_09"}}, {level = 20, spells = {"Cat Form", "Claw", "Omen of Clarity", "Prowl", "Rip", "Shred", "Rebirth", "Starfire", "Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, notes = {"Your leveling form from here.", "Combo point builder.", "Passive in Forever, trained at 20: attacks and spells can make your next ability free. Nothing to rebuff.", "Stealth.", "Bleed finisher.", "Big builder from behind.", "Combat resurrect.", "Balance nuke.", "Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, icons = {"ability_druid_catform", "ability_druid_rake", "spell_nature_crystalball", "ability_ambush", "ability_ghoulfrenzy", "spell_shadow_vampiricaura", "spell_nature_reincarnation", "spell_arcane_starfire", "inv_misc_book_09"}}, {level = 22, spells = {"Soothe Animal", "Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, notes = {"Utility.", "Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, icons = {"ability_hunter_beastsoothe", "inv_misc_book_09"}}, {level = 24, spells = {"Ferocious Bite", "Rake", "Remove Curse", "Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, notes = {"Damage finisher.", "Builder plus bleed.", "Utility.", "Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, icons = {"ability_druid_ferociousbite", "ability_druid_disembowel", "spell_holy_removecurse", "inv_misc_book_09"}}, {level = 26, spells = {"Dash", "Abolish Poison", "Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, notes = {"Cat sprint.", "Utility.", "Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, icons = {"ability_druid_dash", "spell_nature_nullifypoison_02", "inv_misc_book_09"}}, {level = 28, spells = {"Challenging Roar", "Cower", "Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, notes = {"Groups.", "Groups.", "Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, icons = {"ability_druid_challangingroar", "ability_druid_cower", "inv_misc_book_09"}}, {level = 30, spells = {"Travel Form", "Tranquility", "Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, notes = {"Fast outdoor travel.", "Groups.", "Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, icons = {"ability_druid_travelform", "spell_nature_tranquility", "inv_misc_book_09"}}, {level = 32, spells = {"Ravage", "Poised", "Track Humanoids", "Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, notes = {"Opener from Prowl, behind.", "Passive: out of combat at full Energy, your next Energy