 Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, icons = {"spell_nature_stoneclawtotem", "inv_misc_book_09"}}, {level = 46, spells = {"Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, notes = {"Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, icons = {"inv_misc_book_09"}}, {level = 48, spells = {"Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, notes = {"Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, icons = {"inv_misc_book_09"}}, {level = 50, spells = {"Gift of the Wild", "Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, notes = {"Group buff.", "Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, icons = {"spell_nature_regeneration", "inv_misc_book_09"}}, {level = 52, spells = {"Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, notes = {"Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, icons = {"inv_misc_book_09"}}, {level = 54, spells = {"Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, notes = {"Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, icons = {"inv_misc_book_09"}}, {level = 56, spells = {"Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, notes = {"Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, icons = {"inv_misc_book_09"}}, {level = 58, spells = {"Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, notes = {"Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, icons = {"inv_misc_book_09"}}, {level = 60, spells = {"Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, notes = {"Train new ranks of Claw, Rake, Rip, Ferocious Bite, Maul and your heals every visit."}, icons = {"inv_misc_book_09"}}}, br = {{level = 1, icon = "spell_nature_regeneration", title = "Before Forms", range = "Levels 1–9", intro = "A caster with a staff until 10. Pull with spells, finish in melee, heal between pulls.", steps = {"Mark of the Wild and Thorns (6) up.", "Wrath to pull, Moonfire (4) as it runs in.", "Melee it down to save mana.", "Rejuvenation or Healing Touch after the fight."}, stepIcons = {"spell_nature_regeneration", "spell_nature_abolishmagic", "inv_staff_08", "spell_nature_rejuvenation"}}, {level = 10, icon = "spell_nature_starfall", title = "Bear", range = "Levels 10–19", intro = "Do the Bear Form quest at 10 — it isn't on the trainer. Bear is your only form until 20.", steps = {"Moonfire to pull, then shift to Bear.", "Demoralizing Roar → Maul each press.", "Swipe (16) when two or more are on you.", "Controller: the Bear macro on RT+A in Bear Form."}, stepIcons = {"spell_nature_starfall", "ability_druid_demoralizingroar", "inv_misc_monsterclaw_03", "inv_misc_note_01"}}, {level = 20, icon = "spell_nature_crystalball", title = "Cat", range = "Levels 20–29", intro = "Cat Form (20) is how you level from here. Train Omen of Clarity — in Forever it's a passive you train, not a talent.", steps = {"Mark of the Wild and Thorns up, then Cat Form. Omen of Clarity is passive.", "Claw ×3 → Rip; from 24 Rake → Claw ×3 → Ferocious Bite.", "Two or more mobs, or low health? Shift to Bear and Swipe.", "Heal up out of form between pulls."}, stepIcons = {"spell_nature_crystalball", "ability_druid_rake", "ability_racial_bearform", "spell_nature_healingtouch"}}, {level = 30, icon = "ability_druid_travelform", title = "Prowl & Ravage", range = "Levels 30–39", intro = "Travel Form (30) between quests. From 32, open from Prowl with Ravage behind the target.", steps = {"Travel Form outdoors, Cat Form indoors.", "Prowl → get behind → Ravage (32) → Fight macro.", "Leader of the Pack (35) is always on in forms."}, stepIcons = {"ability_druid_travelform", "ability_druid_ravage", "spell_nature_unyeildingstamina"}}, {level = 40, icon = "ability_druid_disembowel", title = "Dire Bear & Shifting Power", range = "Levels 40–60", intro = "Rend and Tear rewards keeping Rake up. Shifting Power (46) refills Energy from your mana.", steps = {"Always open the Fight sequence with Rake — the bleed powers Rend and Tear.", "Shifting Power when Energy runs dry.", "Barkskin (44) when a fight goes wrong; Dire Bear (40) for packs."}, stepIcons = {"ability_druid_disembowel", "spell_druid_displacement", "spell_nature_stoneclawtotem"}}}, spec = "Feral", guide = "Feral Druid"},
  PALADIN = {macros = {{name = "Fight", title = "Fight", icon = "ability_thunderbolt", lo = 6, hi = 19, body = "#showtooltip\n/startattack\n/castsequence reset=target Seal of Righteousness, Judgement, Holy Strike, Judgement, Holy Strike, Judgement, Holy Strike", pad = "RT+A", kb = "1", tips = {"Each press: Seal → Judgement → Holy Strike, three times over, then the seal again (about every 25 sec — the seal lasts 30).", "\"Not ready\": Judgement or Holy Strike is on its 10 sec cooldown — the sequence waits, you keep swinging; press again."}}, {name = "Fight", title = "Fight", icon = "ability_warrior_innerrage", lo = 20, hi = 60, body = "#showtooltip\n/startattack\n/castsequence reset=target Seal of Command, Judgement, Holy Strike, Judgement, Holy Strike, Judgement, Holy Strike", pad = "RT+A", kb = "1", tips = {"Each press: Seal of Command → Judgement → Holy Strike, three times over, then the seal again. Only one seal cast per ~25 sec saves mana.", "\"Not ready\": Judgement or Holy Strike is on cooldown — the sequence waits; press again.", "New target: Starts over with the seal."}}, {name = "Pack", title = "Pack", icon = "spell_holy_innerfire", lo = 20, hi = 60, body = "#showtooltip\n/startattack\n/castsequence reset=target Consecration, Holy Strike, Judgement", pad = "RT+B", kb = "2", tips = {"Each press: Consecration → Holy Strike → Judgement.", "\"Not ready\": A spell is on cooldown — the sequence waits; press again. Shares Judgement and Holy Strike with Fight.", "No seal up? Judgement can\'t fire — press Fight first."}}, {name = "Heal up", title = "Heal up", icon = "spell_holy_flashheal", lo = 1, hi = 60, body = "#showtooltip\n/cast [@player] Flash of Light\n/cast [@player] Holy Light", pad = "LT+A", kb = "Q", tips = {"One press: Heals you even with an enemy targeted. Flash of Light from 20, Holy Light before."}}, {name = "Panic", title = "Panic", icon = "spell_holy_restoration", lo = 6, hi = 33, body = "#showtooltip\n/cast Divine Protection", pad = "LT+X", kb = "F", tips = {"One press: Divine Protection. Then heal with Heal up."}}, {name = "Panic", title = "Panic", icon = "spell_holy_divineintervention", lo = 34, hi = 60, body = "#showtooltip\n/cast Divine Shield", pad = "LT+X", kb = "F", tips = {"One press: Divine Shield — you deal half damage inside it, so heal with Heal up.", "On cooldown: Divine Protection shares the Shield's 5 min cooldown, so it can't back it up — Lay on Hands can."}}}, plan = {{name = "Benediction", tree = "Retribution", from = 10, to = 14, why = "Opens at 10. Seals, Judgement and Holy Strike are all instant, so 5/5 makes your whole rotation 10% cheaper — mana is your leveling bottleneck.", more = "2% cheaper per rank.", max = 5, icon = "spell_frost_windwalkon"}, {name = "Conviction", tree = "Retribution", from = 15, to = 17, why = "Earliest it opens (row 2, level 15). +2% crit per rank on melee, seals, Judgement and Holy Strike — 6% at 3/3, and Vengeance at 30 feeds on crits.", more = "+2% more crit.", max = 3, icon = "spell_holy_retributionaura"}, {name = "Improved Judgement", tree = "Retribution", from = 18, to = 19, why = "Judgement cooldown 10 → 8 sec at 2/2: about one extra Judgement every 40 sec, and Sanctified Judgement refunds mana on each one.", more = "8 sec at 2/2.", max = 2, icon = "spell_holy_righteousfury"}, {name = "Seal of Command", tree = "Retribution", from = 20, to = 20, why = "Earliest it opens (row 3, level 20). Procs Holy damage worth 70% of weapon damage — best on a slow two-hander — and its Judgement deals about 49 at 20 (71 by 28), double on stunned targets. Replaces Seal of Righteousness.", more = "", max = 1, icon = "ability_warrior_innerrage"}, {name = "Pursuit of Justice", tree = "Retribution", from = 21, to = 22, why = "+8% then +15% run and mount speed, always on — the best quality-of-life talent for questing. Doesn't stack with other speed effects.", more = "15% at 2/2.", max = 2, icon = "spell_holy_persuitofjustice"}, {name = "Sanctified Judgement", tree = "Retribution", from = 23, to = 25, why = "Judgement has a 33/66/100% chance to refund 20/40/60% of your seal's mana. At 3/3 every Judgement refunds 60%.", more = "Bigger, surer refund.", max = 3, icon = "ability_paladin_judgementblue"}, {name = "Sacred Arbiter", tree = "Retribution", from = 26, to = 26, why = "Row 4 (opens at 25). Holy Strike +20% damage, and each Holy Strike refreshes all your Judgement effects on the target.", more = "", max = 1, icon = "inv_sword_08"}, {name = "Two-Handed Weapon Specialization", tree = "Retribution", from = 27, to = 29, why = "+2/4/6% Physical and Holy damage with a two-hander (the 2 Nov notes added Holy), plus 7/14/20% less threat in groups.", more = "+2% more.", max = 3, icon = "inv_hammer_04"}, {name = "Vengeance", tree = "Retribution", from = 30, to = 32, why = "Earliest it opens (row 5, level 30; needs Seal of Command). Each crit gives +1/2/3% Physical and Holy damage for 30 sec, stacking 5 times — +15% at 3/3. With 6% Conviction it stays up.", more = "+1% more per stack.", max = 3, icon = "ability_racial_avatar"}, {name = "Repentance", tree = "Retribution", from = 33, to = 33, why = "6-sec incapacitate on a Humanoid add (1 min cooldown, damage breaks it). Also required for Unsealed Wrath at 40.", more = "", max = 1, icon = "spell_holy_prayerofhealing"}, {name = "Vindication", tree = "Retribution", from = 34, to = 36, why = "Your melee hits can cut the target's Attack Power for 30 sec — less damage taken every fight.", more = "Stronger weaken.", max = 3, icon = "spell_holy_vindication"}, {name = "Champion of the Light", tree = "Retribution", from = 37, to = 39, why = "Row 6 (opens at 35). Adds 12% of your Intellect per rank as spell damage — seals, Judgement and Consecration hit harder — and cuts Hammer of Wrath's cast by 0.2 sec per rank.", more = "+12% of Intellect.", max = 5, icon = "ability_paladin_enlightenedjudgements"}, {name = "Unsealed Wrath", tree = "Retribution", from = 40, to = 40, why = "Earliest it opens (row 7, level 40; needs Repentance). Each swing stores a copy of your Seal for 15 sec (up to 3); your next hit with a different Seal releases them, each with its normal proc chance.", more = "", max = 1, icon = "spell_holy_blessedresillience"}, {name = "Divine Strength", tree = "Holy", from = 41, to = 45, why = "Holy row 1, no prerequisites. +2% Strength per rank, 10% at 5/5 — more Attack Power on every swing.", more = "+2% more.", max = 5, icon = "ability_golemthunderclap"}, {name = "Champion of the Light", tree = "Retribution", from = 46, to = 47, why = "Finish Champion of the Light: 60% of your Intellect as spell damage, and Hammer of Wrath (44) becomes instant.", more = "", max = 5, icon = "ability_paladin_enlightenedjudgements"}, {name = "Reverence", tree = "Holy", from = 48, to = 49, why = "Holy row 2, opened by your 5 Divine Strength points. 15/30% of your mana regen keeps going while casting — fewer drink breaks.", more = "30% at 2/2.", max = 2, icon = "spell_holy_divineillumination"}, {name = "Improved Seals", tree = "Holy", from = 50, to = 54, why = "+3% per rank to Seal and Judgement damage — 15% at 5/5, covering Seal of Command procs and every Judgement.", more = "+3% more.", max = 5, icon = "ability_thunderbolt"}, {name = "Divine Intellect", tree = "Protection", from = 55, to = 59, why = "Protection row 1. +2% Intellect per rank (10% at 5/5): more mana, and more spell damage through Champion of the Light.", more = "+2% more.", max = 5, icon = "spell_nature_sleep"}, {name = "Precision", tree = "Protection", from = 60, to = 60, why = "Protection row 2, opened by Divine Intellect. +1% melee hit — fewer misses on level-60 mobs.", more = "", max = 3, icon = "ability_rogue_ambush"}}, train = {{level = 1, spells = {"Seal of Righteousness (Rank 1)", "Devotion Aura (Rank 1)", "Holy Light (Rank 1)"}, notes = {"Your seal until Seal of Command at 20.", "Armor aura.", "Slow, big heal between fights."}, icons = {"ability_thunderbolt", "spell_holy_devotionaura", "spell_holy_holybolt"}}, {level = 4, spells = {"Blessing of Might (Rank 1)", "Judgement"}, notes = {"Attack Power — lasts an hour.", "No longer eats your seal in Forever. 10 sec cooldown, 10 yd range."}, icons = {"spell_holy_fistofjustice", "spell_holy_righteousfury"}}, {level = 6, spells = {"Holy Strike (Rank 1)", "Divine Protection (Rank 1)", "Holy Light (Rank 2)", "Seal of the Crusader (Rank 1)"}, notes = {"New: instant strike, 10 sec cooldown.", "Emergency immunity.", "Slow, big heal between fights.", "Weak for leveling."}, icons = {"classicon_paladin", "spell_holy_restoration", "spell_holy_holybolt", "spell_holy_holysmite"}}, {level = 8, spells = {"Hammer of Justice (Rank 1)", "Purify"}, notes = {"Stun — stops casters and runners.", "Remove poison/disease."}, icons = {"spell_holy_sealofmight", "spell_holy_purify"}}, {level = 10, spells = {"Lay on Hands (Rank 1)", "Seal of Righteousness (Rank 2)", "Devotion Aura (Rank 2)", "Blessing of Protection (Rank 1)", "Righteous Fury", "Seal of Fury (Rank 1)"}, notes = {"Full heal, 20 min cooldown.", "Your seal until Seal of Command at 20.", "Armor aura.", "Save a friend.", "Tanking only.", "Tank seal."}, icons = {"spell_holy_layonhands", "ability_thunderbolt", "spell_holy_devotionaura", "spell_holy_sealofprotection", "spell_holy_sealoffury", "spell_holy_retributionaura"}}, {level = 12, spells = {"Holy Strike (Rank 2)", "Blessing of Might (Rank 2)", "Redemption (Rank 1)", "Seal of the Crusader (Rank 2)"}, notes = {"New: instant strike, 10 sec cooldown.", "Attack Power — lasts an hour.", "Resurrect.", "Weak for leveling."}, icons = {"classicon_paladin", "spell_holy_fistofjustice", "spell_holy_resurrection", "spell_holy_holysmite"}}, {level = 14, spells = {"Holy Light (Rank 3)", "Blessing of Wisdom (Rank 1)"}, notes = {"Slow, big heal between fights.", "Swap in if mana is tight."}, icons = {"spell_holy_holybolt", "spell_holy_sealofwisdom"}}, {level = 16, spells = {"Retribution Aura (Rank 1)"}, notes = {"Damages attackers — great on packs."}, icon