, Lightning Shield, imbues."}, notes = {"Train every new rank each visit: shocks, bolts, heals, totems, Fire Nova, Lightning Shield, imbues."}, icons = {"inv_misc_book_09"}}, {level = 60, spells = {"Train every new rank each visit: shocks, bolts, heals, totems, Fire Nova, Lightning Shield, imbues."}, notes = {"Train every new rank each visit: shocks, bolts, heals, totems, Fire Nova, Lightning Shield, imbues."}, icons = {"inv_misc_book_09"}}}, br = {{level = 1, icon = "spell_nature_rockbiter", title = "Before Talents", range = "Levels 1–9", intro = "Melee with the biggest two-hander you can find — your weapon is your damage. Heal up with Healing Wave between pulls.", steps = {"Rockbiter Weapon on, and Lightning Shield (8) up.", "Pull with Lightning Bolt, then let it come to you.", "Earth Shock (4) in melee — and to interrupt casters.", "Healing Wave after the fight, not during."}, stepIcons = {"spell_nature_rockbiter", "spell_nature_lightning", "spell_nature_earthshock", "spell_nature_magicimmunity"}}, {level = 10, icon = "spell_fire_searingtotem", title = "Shocks & Totems", range = "Levels 10–19", intro = "Searing Totem does free damage and Flame Shock opens. Stay on Rockbiter until 30.", steps = {"Drop Searing Totem (and Strength of Earth) before you pull.", "Flame Shock → melee → Earth Shock every cooldown.", "Stoneclaw Totem pulls an extra mob off you.", "Controller: the Fight macro on RT+A does this order."}, stepIcons = {"spell_fire_searingtotem", "spell_fire_flameshock", "spell_nature_stoneclawtotem", "inv_misc_note_01"}}, {level = 20, icon = "spell_shaman_dropall_01", title = "Stormstrike", range = "Levels 20–29", intro = "Set your Totem Bar and drop everything with Call of the Elements (20) — buff totems last 5 min now, Searing only 35 sec. Ghost Wolf cuts travel time. Stormstrike arrives at 25.", steps = {"Call of the Elements before the pull.", "Flame Shock → Stormstrike → Earth Shock → Stormstrike: one shock and one Stormstrike every 6 sec.", "Totemic Recall when you leave the area: 25% of the totems' mana back."}, stepIcons = {"spell_shaman_dropall_01", "ability_shaman_stormstrike", "spell_shaman_totemrecall"}}, {level = 30, icon = "spell_nature_cyclone", title = "Windfury", range = "Levels 30–39", intro = "Windfury Weapon (30) replaces Rockbiter — get the slowest two-hander you can. Maelstrom Weapon from 35.", steps = {"Windfury Weapon on, always.", "Same Fight order: shocks and Stormstrike on cooldown.", "At 5 Maelstrom stacks, Lightning Bolt — free and instant at 5/5.", "Chain Lightning (32) and Fire Nova on packs."}, stepIcons = {"spell_nature_cyclone", "ability_shaman_stormstrike", "spell_shaman_maelstromweapon", "spell_nature_chainlightning"}}, {level = 40, icon = "spell_nature_bloodlust", title = "Rage of the Farseer", range = "Levels 40–60", intro = "Rage of the Farseer (40) gives +30% attack speed for 25 sec. Instant Ghost Wolf from 42.", steps = {"Rage of the Farseer on elites and big pulls.", "Fight button as before; Maelstrom bolts at 5 stacks.", "Lesser Healing Wave if a fight goes long."}, stepIcons = {"spell_nature_bloodlust", "ability_shaman_stormstrike", "spell_nature_healingwavelesser"}}}, spec = "Enhancement", guide = "Enhancement Shaman"},
  WARLOCK = {macros = {{name = "Fight", title = "Fight", icon = "spell_shadow_curseofsargeras", lo = 8, hi = 13, body = "#showtooltip\n/petattack\n/castsequence [nochanneling] reset=target Corruption, Bane of Agony, Immolate, Shadow Bolt, Shadow Bolt", pad = "RT+A", kb = "1", tips = {"Each press: Sends your demon, then casts the next spell in order: Corruption → Agony → Immolate → Shadow Bolt ×2, then back to Corruption.", "New target: Starts over from Corruption.", "Mob nearly dead: Don't loop back — Agony would be re-cast early. Wand or Drain Soul (10+) instead."}}, {name = "Fight", title = "Fight", icon = "spell_shadow_lifedrain02", lo = 14, hi = 30, body = "#showtooltip\n/petattack\n/castsequence [nochanneling] reset=target Corruption, Bane of Agony, Immolate, Drain Life, Drain Life, Drain Life", pad = "RT+A", kb = "1", tips = {"Each press: Corruption → Agony → Immolate → Drain Life ×3. Three drains last about as long as your DoTs, so the next press refreshes them.", "Channeling: [nochanneling] stops a press from cutting your drain short — mash freely."}}, {name = "Fight", title = "Fight", icon = "spell_shadow_requiem", lo = 31, hi = 39, body = "#showtooltip\n/petattack\n/castsequence [nochanneling] reset=target Corruption, Bane of Agony, Siphon Life, Drain Life, Drain Life, Drain Life", pad = "RT+A", kb = "1", tips = {"Each press: Corruption → Agony → Siphon Life → Drain Life ×3, then refresh.", "Why Siphon over Immolate: Siphon Life is a Shadow DoT that heals you and counts for Soul Siphon; Immolate is Fire and does neither."}}, {name = "Fight", title = "Fight", icon = "ability_deathknight_hemorrhagicfever", lo = 40, hi = 60, body = "#showtooltip\n/petattack\n/castsequence [nochanneling] reset=target Corruption, Bane of Agony, Siphon Life, Wrack, Drain Life, Drain Life", pad = "RT+A", kb = "1", tips = {"Each press: Corruption → Agony → Siphon Life → Wrack → Drain Life ×2, then refresh.", "Wrack: a 6 sec channel — your other Shadow DoTs on the target take 10% more while it runs.", "Channeling: [nochanneling] stops a press from cutting Wrack or a drain short — mash freely."}}, {name = "Healthstone", title = "Healthstone", icon = "inv_stone_04", lo = 10, hi = 60, body = "#showtooltip\n/use Major Healthstone\n/use Greater Healthstone\n/use Healthstone\n/use Lesser Healthstone\n/use Minor Healthstone", pad = "LT+B", kb = "E", tips = {"One press: Eats whichever Healthstone you have — no need to rebind as the rank goes up."}}, {name = "Pet taunt", title = "Pet taunt", icon = "spell_shadow_gathershadows", lo = 10, hi = 60, body = "#showtooltip Torment\n/petattack\n/cast Torment", pad = "RT+↑", kb = "X", tips = {"One press: Sends your demon at your target; a Voidwalker also casts Torment to pull it off you.", "Other demons: Torment isn't known, so that line is skipped and the press still sends the pet.", "On cooldown: Torment is the last line, so its cooldown blocks nothing else."}}}, plan = {{name = "Improved Corruption", tree = "Affliction", from = 10, to = 14, why = "From 14 (5/5) Corruption is instant and hits 10% harder: cast it while running up, on every mob, to 60.", more = "Another 0.4 sec off Corruption.", max = 5, icon = "spell_shadow_abominationexplosion"}, {name = "Suppression", tree = "Affliction", from = 15, to = 17, why = "Every resisted DoT is wasted mana and a mob that reaches you sooner. Three points get you most of the way to never missing.", more = "+1% more hit.", max = 5, icon = "spell_shadow_unsummonbuilding"}, {name = "Improved Life Tap", tree = "Affliction", from = 18, to = 19, why = "Life Tap is your mana bar. 20% more mana per tap means fewer taps, less health to drain back.", more = "Life Tap gives another 10%.", max = 2, icon = "spell_shadow_burningspirit"}, {name = "Fel Concentration", tree = "Affliction", from = 20, to = 22, why = "The drain-tank talent. At 3/3, hits have a 70% chance not to push back Drain Life, so you can stand and drain through damage.", more = "More pushback protection.", max = 3, icon = "spell_shadow_fingerofdeath"}, {name = "Improved Drains", tree = "Affliction", from = 23, to = 25, why = "Drain Life, Drain Soul and Drain Mana do 7% more per point, 20% at 3/3. Drain Life lost 28% in Forever, so this keeps it useful.", more = "Drains 13%, then 20% stronger.", max = 3, icon = "spell_shadow_haunting"}, {name = "Nightfall", tree = "Affliction", from = 26, to = 27, why = "Corruption, drains and Wrack get a 2% chance per tick to make your next Shadow Bolt instant.", more = "Proc chance 4%.", max = 2, icon = "spell_shadow_twilight"}, {name = "Pandemic", tree = "Affliction", from = 28, to = 30, why = "DoT and drain crits get +33% bonus crit damage per point (+100% at 3/3) — more from spells you already cast.", more = "Bigger crit bonus.", max = 3, icon = "spell_shadow_unstableaffliction_2"}, {name = "Siphon Life", tree = "Affliction", from = 31, to = 31, why = "Instant 30 sec DoT that heals you 11 every 3 sec (41 at rank 4). Corruption + Agony + Siphon Life is the core setup and three effects for Soul Siphon.", more = "", max = 1, icon = "spell_shadow_requiem"}, {name = "Soul Siphon", tree = "Affliction", from = 32, to = 34, why = "Drain Life gets up to 36% stronger with your other effects on the target — so DoT first, then drain.", more = "+4% more per effect.", max = 3, icon = "spell_shadow_lifedrain02"}, {name = "Shadow Mastery", tree = "Affliction", from = 35, to = 39, why = "Every Shadow spell — Corruption, Agony, Siphon, Drain Life, Shadow Bolt — deals 10% more.", more = "+2% more Shadow damage.", max = 5, icon = "spell_shadow_shadetruesight"}, {name = "Wrack", tree = "Affliction", from = 40, to = 40, why = "The capstone: a 200-mana channel (86 Shadow per second at 60, buffed 2 Nov) that makes your other Shadow DoTs deal 10% more for 6 sec.", more = "", max = 1, icon = "ability_deathknight_hemorrhagicfever"}, {name = "Malevolence", tree = "Affliction", from = 41, to = 45, why = "+1% Shadow crit per point — more crits for Pandemic's +100% bonus.", more = "+1% more Shadow crit.", max = 5, icon = "spell_shadow_focusedpower"}, {name = "Improved Bane of Agony", tree = "Affliction", from = 46, to = 47, why = "Bane of Agony is on every target; 10% more is free damage.", more = "+5% more Agony damage.", max = 2, icon = "spell_shadow_curseofsargeras"}, {name = "Suppression", tree = "Affliction", from = 48, to = 49, why = "Higher-level mobs resist more. Suppression to 5/5 for 5% hit.", more = "+1% more hit.", max = 5, icon = "spell_shadow_unsummonbuilding"}, {name = "Grim Reach", tree = "Affliction", from = 50, to = 50, why = "Affliction spells reach 10% further — pull from safer distance.", more = "", max = 2, icon = "spell_shadow_callofbone"}, {name = "Unholy Power", tree = "Demonology", from = 51, to = 55, why = "Affliction is done. Your demon does a big share of your damage — 10% more from Unholy Power.", more = "+2% more demon damage.", max = 5, icon = "spell_shadow_shadowworddominate"}, {name = "Demonic Energies", tree = "Demonology", from = 56, to = 57, why = "Your spells now heal your demon, and Life Tap shares mana with it. Your Voidwalker barely needs Health Funnel.", more = "Pet healing doubled.", max = 2, icon = "spell_shadow_felmending"}, {name = "Fel Vitality", tree = "Demonology", from = 58, to = 60, why = "15% more health and mana for your demon, and 15% more mana for you.", more = "+5% more.", max = 3, icon = "spell_shadow_demonictactics"}}, train = {{level = 1, spells = {"Shadow Bolt (Rank 1)", "Immolate (Rank 1)", "Demon Skin (Rank 1)", "Summon Imp"}, notes = {"Opener early; Nightfall procs later.", "Fire DoT — good early, drop it if mana is tight once Siphon Life is up.", "Armor buff until Demon Armor.", "Your first demon."}, icons = {"spell_shadow_shadowbolt", "spell_fire_immolation", "spell_shadow_ragingscream", "spell_shadow_summonimp"}}, {level = 4, spells = {"Corruption (Rank 1)", "Curse of Weakness (Rank 1)"}, notes = {"Your core DoT.", "Less melee damage taken. Banes and Curses stack in Forever."}, icons = {"spell_shadow_abominationexplosion", "spell_shadow_curseofmannoroth"}}, {level = 6, spells = {"Life Tap (Rank 1)", "Shadow Bolt (Rank 2)"}, notes = {"Health into mana.", "Opener early; Nightfall procs later."}, icons = {"spell_shadow_burningspirit", "spell_shadow_shadowbolt"}}, {level = 8, spells = {"Bane of Agony (Rank 1)", "Fear (Rank 1)"}, notes = {"Your second DoT (was Curse of Agony).", "Only with open space — fleeing mobs pull friends."}, icons = {"spell_shadow_curseofsargeras", "spell_shadow_possession"}}, {level = 10, spells = {"Summon Voidwalker", "Drain Soul (Rank 1)", "Create Healthstone (Rank 1)", "Demon Skin (Rank 2)", "Immolate (Rank 2)"}, notes = {"From your level-10 class quest.", "Finisher — killing a non-trivial mob with it always gives a Soul Shard.", "Free emergency heal.", "Armor buff until Demon Armor.", "Fire DoT — good early, drop it if mana is tight once Siphon Life is up."}, icons = {"spell_shadow_summonvoidwalker", "spell_shadow_haunting", "inv_stone_04", "spell_shadow_ragingscream", "spell_fire_immolation"}}, {level = 12, spells = {"Health Funnel (Rank 1)", "Shadow Bolt (Rank 3)", "Curse of Weakness (Rank 2)"}, notes = {"Heal your demon.", "Opener early; Nightfall procs later.", "Less melee damage taken. Banes and Curses stack in Forever."}, icons = {"spell_shadow_lifedrain", "spell_shadow_shadowbolt", "spell_shadow_curseofmannoroth"}}, {level = 14, spells = {"Drain Life (Rank 1)", "Corruption (Rank 2)", "Curse of Recklessness (Rank 1)"}, notes = {"Your main channel and heal. 20 yd range, shorter than your DoTs.", "Your core DoT.", "Armor reduction; not for casters."}, icons = {"spell_shadow_lifedrain02", "spell_shadow_abominationexplosion", "spell_shadow_unholystrength"}}, {level = 16, spells = {"Life Tap (Rank 2)", "Unending Breath"}, notes = {"Health into mana.", "Underwater quests."}, icons = {"spell_shadow_burningspirit", "spell_shadow_demonbreath"}}, {level = 18, spells = {"Bane of Agony (Rank 2)", "Create S