to mana.", "Only with open space — fleeing mobs pull friends.", "Armor reduction; not for casters.", "Destruction nuke.", "Fire weapon enchant — Spellstone is better for you."}, icons = {"spell_shadow_burningspirit", "spell_shadow_possession", "spell_shadow_unholystrength", "spell_fire_fireball02", "inv_misc_gem_bloodstone_02"}}, {level = 58, spells = {"Bane of Agony (Rank 6)", "Siphon Life (Rank 4)", "Death Coil (Rank 3)", "Create Healthstone (Rank 5)", "Rain of Fire (Rank 4)", "Searing Pain (Rank 6)", "Subjugate Demon (Rank 3)"}, notes = {"Your second DoT (was Curse of Agony).", "New rank of your healing DoT.", "Instant damage, heals you for 100% of it, 3 sec fear. 2 min cooldown.", "Free emergency heal.", "AoE in groups.", "Destruction filler.", "Situational."}, icons = {"spell_shadow_curseofsargeras", "spell_shadow_requiem", "spell_shadow_deathcoil", "inv_stone_04", "spell_shadow_rainoffire", "spell_fire_soulburn", "spell_shadow_enslavedemon"}}, {level = 60, spells = {"Corruption (Rank 7)", "Shadow Bolt (Rank 10)", "Demon Armor (Rank 5)", "Immolate (Rank 8)", "Health Funnel (Rank 7)", "Create Spellstone (Rank 3)", "Create Soulstone (Rank 5)", "Shadow Ward (Rank 4)", "Bane of Doom", "Ritual of Doom"}, notes = {"Your core DoT.", "Ranks 9 and 10.", "Replaces Demon Skin.", "Ranks 7 and 8.", "Heal your demon.", "Weapon enchant: + Shadow damage and spell haste.", "Self-res before risky pulls.", "Vs. shadow casters.", "Big hit after 1 min on long fights. Replaces your Agony — one Bane per target.", "Situational."}, icons = {"spell_shadow_abominationexplosion", "spell_shadow_shadowbolt", "spell_shadow_ragingscream", "spell_fire_immolation", "spell_shadow_lifedrain", "inv_misc_gem_sapphire_01", "spell_shadow_soulgem", "spell_shadow_antishadow", "spell_shadow_auraofdarkness", "spell_shadow_antimagicshell"}}}, br = {{level = 1, icon = "spell_shadow_summonimp", title = "Before Talents", range = "Levels 1–9", intro = "Your Imp does steady damage from range while you stack DoTs and finish with a wand. Spend as little mana as possible.", steps = {"Demon Skin and your Imp out at all times.", "Open with Immolate, then Shadow Bolt.", "From 4: Corruption on every target; from 8: Bane of Agony too.", "Let the DoTs tick and finish with your wand (Shoot).", "From 6: Life Tap when mana runs low, then eat the health back between pulls."}, stepIcons = {"spell_shadow_summonimp", "spell_fire_immolation", "spell_shadow_abominationexplosion", "inv_wand_01", "spell_shadow_burningspirit"}}, {level = 10, icon = "spell_shadow_summonvoidwalker", title = "The Voidwalker", range = "Levels 10–19", intro = "Do your level-10 class quest for the Voidwalker. It holds mobs while your DoTs work — this is how Warlocks level.", steps = {"Send the Voidwalker in and let it hit twice before you attack.", "Corruption (instant from 14) → Bane of Agony → Immolate.", "Wand while the DoTs tick.", "Drain Soul to finish — a kill always gives a Soul Shard.", "From 14: Drain Life when your health drops, then Life Tap the mana back.", "Voidwalker abilities (Torment, Sacrifice, Consume Shadows) come from Grimoires sold by the demon trainer.", "Controller: the Fight macro casts your DoTs in order, one per press."}, stepIcons = {"spell_shadow_summonvoidwalker", "spell_shadow_abominationexplosion", "inv_wand_01", "spell_shadow_haunting", "spell_shadow_lifedrain02", "inv_misc_book_09", "inv_misc_note_01"}}, {level = 20, icon = "spell_shadow_abominationexplosion", title = "Drain Tank", range = "Levels 20–29", intro = "Fel Concentration (20–22) gives your drains a 70% chance to ignore each hit's pushback. Now you can stand in melee and drain through the damage.", steps = {"Corruption and Bane of Agony on the target.", "Drain Life, and keep draining — Improved Drains (23–25) adds 20% to its damage and healing. Stay within 20 yd.", "Life Tap → Drain Life is your mana loop. You rarely need to drink.", "Demon Armor (20) on at all times.", "Nightfall (26+): when you glow purple, cast the instant Shadow Bolt.", "Soulstone yourself before anything risky."}, stepIcons = {"spell_shadow_abominationexplosion", "spell_shadow_lifedrain02", "spell_shadow_burningspirit", "spell_shadow_ragingscream", "spell_shadow_twilight", "spell_shadow_soulgem"}}, {level = 30, icon = "spell_shadow_requiem", title = "Siphon Life", range = "Levels 30–39", intro = "Siphon Life (31) is a second healing DoT, and Soul Siphon makes Drain Life stronger for every effect you have on the target. DoT first, then drain.", steps = {"Corruption → Bane of Agony → Siphon Life → Drain Life.", "Felhunter (30) for caster-heavy areas; its Spell Lock interrupt comes at 36.", "Spellstone (36) on your weapon.", "Two mobs: DoT both, Voidwalker on one, Fear the other only if there's open ground.", "Health Funnel your demon between pulls."}, stepIcons = {"spell_shadow_requiem", "spell_shadow_summonfelhunter", "inv_misc_gem_sapphire_01", "spell_shadow_possession", "spell_shadow_lifedrain"}}, {level = 40, icon = "ability_deathknight_hemorrhagicfever", title = "Wrack", range = "Levels 40–60", intro = "Wrack (40) is a channel (86 Shadow per second at 60) that makes your other Shadow DoTs deal 10% more for 6 sec. Shadow Mastery adds 10% to every Shadow spell.", steps = {"DoTs → Wrack → Drain Life.", "Death Coil (42) — instant damage that heals you and fears the mob for 3 sec. 2 min cooldown, so it has its own button.", "Howl of Terror (40) when a pack is on you — careful, they run.", "Shadow Bolt on every Nightfall proc.", "Demonic Energies (56+) heals your demon with your damage."}, stepIcons = {"ability_deathknight_hemorrhagicfever", "spell_shadow_deathcoil", "spell_shadow_deathscream", "spell_shadow_twilight", "spell_shadow_felmending"}}}, spec = "Affliction", guide = "Affliction Warlock"},
}
